  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/wordmarks/outlined/cracked/f64_wordmark.png\" alt=\"Faithful 64x\">\n<h1 style=\"font-weight:900\"><br>Minecraft 的首選 64x 材質包。</h1>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/faithful-64x-bedrock\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/bedrock_button.png\" alt=\"在此取得基岩版材質包\"> </a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><hr><p>這是 Minecraft 材質升級的邏輯下一步。與 Faithful 32x 一樣，本材質包以預設美術風格為基礎——以四倍解析度精緻重製，並加入恰到好處的額外細節，帶來完美的原版風格 Minecraft 體驗。<br><br>由於其材質直接基於 32x 版本，因此能與其他材質包保持高度一致性，且品質持續提升。如果您喜歡細緻的材質包，但仍想保留原版風格，本材質包將是您的最佳選擇！</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/discord_button.png\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/website_button.png\" alt=\"官方網站\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">其他資訊：</h1><p>如果您有任何意見回饋、想回報錯誤或需要協助，歡迎加入上方的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 伺服器、在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Faithful-64x-Java/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 提交問題，或於下方留言。如有任何商業或發行相關問題，請參閱我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252flicense\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">許可協議</a>。<br><br>所有材質與附加內容均由貢獻者利用業餘時間自願提供。任何人都可透過上方的 Discord 伺服器提交材質，或製作 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252faddons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附加內容</a> 以正式收錄於我們的網站。開始之前，請務必閱讀我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.faithfulpack.net%252fpages%252ftextures%252ff64-texturing-guidelines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">材質繪製指南</a>，其中明確說明了本材質包的藝術風格。<br><br>每個材質包皆收錄於我們的 <a href=\"faithfulpack.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方網站</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faithful_resource_pack/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252ffaithful_resource_pack%252fsubmissions%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFaithful-Resource-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>，部分材質包亦收錄於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fuser%252ffaithful-resource-pack%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCPEDL</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/Faithful_Resource_Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 論壇</a>。<strong>任何從其他網站下載的版本均屬非官方、未受支援，且可能存在安全風險！</strong>請務必在網路上保持安全。</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">我們的其他專案：</h1><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/f32_button.png\" alt=\"Faithful 32x\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-pa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-pa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32_button.png\" alt=\"Classic Faithful 32x\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32j_button.png\" alt=\"Classic Faithful 32x Jappa\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:1142px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf64j_button.png\" alt=\"Classic Faithful 64x Jappa\"></a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><hr><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:smaller\">Faithful 是一系列開源且由社群驅動的 Minecraft 材質包，旨在提供更高解析度的預設 Minecraft 材質，同時忠於原始風格。</div>",
